    question: 'How does SMS margin math change which tool I pick?',
    answer: 'Model contribution margin per recovered order: gross margin minus discount depth, per-message platform and carrier fees, MMS premiums, and the opt-out cost of higher frequency. A platform with a higher monthly fee but lower per-message cost can win the margin math at your volume, so model twelve months of sends, not the first invoice.',
